OL,3,GNEWSAMajor blaze at former Lanarkshire
OL,4,Aprimary school building
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are tackling a major blaze
OL,7,Fthat has taken hold at a former primary
OL,8,Fschool building in North Lanarkshire.
OL,10,FSix Scottish Fire and Rescue crews,
OL,11,Falongside specialist resources and
OL,12,Faerial appliances, were called to the
OL,13,Fformer Greenhill Primary School site in
OL,14,FCoatbridge at about 17:20.
OL,16,FImages from the scene showed the
OL,17,Fbuilding was badly damaged with flames
OL,18,Fshooting from the roof.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
